%% RailBlock AI — Complete Workflow (Mermaid) — v1.0.1-prototype, 2026-09-01
%% 18 services, 27 entities, 7+1 sources, 3 horizons, human-approved
graph TD
    %% Phase 0
    A[START<br/>Select Horizon<br/>WEEKLY 01-07<br/>MONTHLY 01-30<br/>DAILY single] --> B[Import 7+1 Sources<br/>TMS→ENG<br/>SMMS→S&T<br/>TDMS→TRACTION<br/>COA→Assets<br/>Timetable<br/>Goods Forecast<br/>Resources<br/>+ Historical Execution]

    %% Phase 1
    B --> C[Adapters<br/>expected_columns<br/>load/normalize/validate/to_canonical]
    C --> D{Structural Validation<br/>Header/Field}
    D -->|FAIL MISSING_COLUMN| D1[ImportRun rejected<br/>row,field,severity,code,message<br/>UNKNOWN_CORRIDOR]
    D -->|PASS| E[Normalize<br/>IDs/departments/locations/dates]
    E --> F{Referential<br/>corridor/asset/resource/dependency exists?}
    F -->|NO| F1[UNKNOWN_ASSET etc rejected]
    F -->|YES| G{Operational<br/>durations/deadlines/block types/isolation}
    G -->|NO| G1[INVALID_DURATION rejected]
    G -->|YES| H{Duplicate<br/>composite keys}
    H -->|YES duplicate| H1[duplicate_count deterministic<br/>second import duplicate 15]
    H -->|NO| I[Persist Transactionally<br/>savepoints per record<br/>cached sets bulk no N+1<br/>ImportRun + AuditEvent]

    %% Phase 2
    I --> J[Asset & Corridor Mapping<br/>COR-*/SEC-*/LIN-*/AST-*]
    J --> K[Priority Engine<br/>P=0.30S+0.20U+0.20C+0.15O+0.10D+0.05R<br/>+ historical Δ +8/-2<br/>RuleConfiguration versioned]
    K --> L[Candidate Windows<br/>Templates 01:00-03:00<br/>13:30-15:30<br/>02:00-06:00<br/>max240 Asia/Kolkata<br/>bulk train_map/goods_map/existing_map]

    %% Phase 3
    L --> M{Check Each Task-Window<br/>check_task_window_fit}
    M -->|corridor/section/line mismatch| M1[HARD_CONFLICT]
    M -->|block_type/power/signal mismatch| M1
    M -->|needed > available| M1
    M -->|window REJECTED| M1
    M -->|goods_risk ≥70| M1
    M -->|goods_risk ≥40| M2[SOFT_RISK]
    M -->|Train protected<br/>[departure-buffer, arrival+buffer)<br/>overlap=train_start<block_end && train_end>block_start| M1
    M -->|PASS| N[FEASIBLE<br/>expected_train_count<br/>goods_risk_score<br/>REJECTED otherwise]

    %% Phase 4
    N --> O[Compatibility & Grouping<br/>MAX_GROUP_SIZE 3<br/>same corridor/section/line/date/type/power/signal/resources/dependencies<br/>duration≤240]
    O --> P[Baseline FCFS<br/>priority DESC, first feasible<br/>no grouping]
    O --> Q[CP-SAT Optimizer<br/>x[tid,wid] y[gid,wid] BoolVar<br/>task≤1 window≤1 resource/date<br/>dependency ordering<br/>5s 8 workers<br/>int times]

    %% Phase 5
    Q --> R{Solver Result}
    R -->|OPTIMAL/FEASIBLE| S[Candidate Plan]
    R -->|INFEASIBLE/TIME_LIMIT/UNKNOWN| T[Fallback Greedy<br/>multi-dept max3 validated]
    T --> S
    S --> U[Independent Validator<br/>14 checks A-L + grouping]
    U -->|FAIL TRAIN_CONFLICT etc| U1[do not save as approved<br/>return violations 400]
    U -->|PASS valid:true| V[DRAFT BlockPlan<br/>blocks, block_tasks, unscheduled + reasons<br/>baseline vs optimized<br/>objective breakdown]

    %% Phase 6
    V --> W{Planner Review<br/>Edit Draft?}
    W -->|Yes| W1[PATCH /draft-blocks/{blk}<br/>service_date/start_time<br/>→ 200 if DRAFT + valid<br/>else 400 TRAIN/RESOURCE/POWER/DEPENDENCY<br/>AuditEvent EDIT old/new]
    W -->|No| X[Submit for Review<br/>POST .../submit-review<br/>DRAFT→UNDER_REVIEW 200<br/>else 400 Only DRAFT]
    X --> Y{Approve?<br/>POST .../approve<br/>CONTROL_OFFICE/ADMIN only}
    Y -->|empty 401| Y1[401 Approver identity required]
    Y -->|VIEWER/ENG 403| Y2[403 not authorized]
    Y -->|CONTROL_OFFICE 200<br/>valid:true| Z[APPROVED<br/>Approval + AuditEvent<br/>Notification 5 depts]
    Y -->|Reject no reason 400| Y3[REJECTED]
    Z --> Z1[Publish<br/>PUBLISHED]

    %% Phase 7
    Z1 --> AA[Department Visibility<br/>GET .../approved-plans?department=ENG<br/>GET .../department-view?department=TRACTION<br/>my_blocks 7/5/6 integrated 13/15/14<br/>CONTROL_OFFICE 0/20 VIEWER 0/20 no leak]
    AA --> AB[Execution<br/>POST /api/blocks/{BLK-*}/execution<br/>actual_start/end, status, completed_task_ids<br/>service_date, recorded_by]
    AB --> AC{Validation}
    AC -->|WND-* 400| AC1[Never use WND where BLK required]
    AC -->|unknown 404| AC2[Block not found]
    AC -->|actual_end<start 400| AC3
    AC -->|cancel without reason 400| AC3
    AC -->|task not in block 400| AC3
    AC -->|malformed 422| AC4[VALIDATION_ERROR]
    AC -->|duplicate same 200 idempotent<br/>diff 409| AC5
    AC -->|PASS 201| AD[ExecutionRecord EXE-*]
    AD --> AE[Update Block/Task statuses<br/>COMPLETED LOCKED<br/>AuditEvent EXECUTION]
    AE --> AF[Metrics<br/>GET /api/metrics/{id}<br/>planned_vs_actual delta<br/>asset_downtime/availability<br/>completion_rate<br/>Recharts]

    %% Phase 8
    AF --> AG{Emergency?}
    AG -->|No| AH[Monitor]
    AG -->|Yes| AI[Replan<br/>POST .../replan {reason}<br/>freeze completed/locked<br/>regenerate windows<br/>recalculate priority<br/>rebuild groups<br/>optimizer → validate]
    AI --> AJ[New Version<br/>base_plan_id new_plan_id<br/>preserved 19 moved/displaced/new + reasons<br/>Execution history preserved]
    AJ --> AK[Approve Revision<br/>POST .../revisions {expected_version}<br/>200 else 409 stale]
    AK --> AL[Export<br/>GET .../export?format=csv → 200 text/csv<br/>?format=pdf → 200<br/>contains PLAN-*]

    style A fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#333
    style Z fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2
    style AD fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#4caf50
    style AC1 fill:#ffebee,stroke:#f44336
